{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15997","headline":"伤邻家鹦鹉词 · 王建","name":"伤邻家鹦鹉词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东家小女不惜钱，买得鹦鹉独自怜。\n自从死却家中女，无人更共鹦鹉语。\n十日不饮一滴浆，泪渍绿毛头似鼠。\n舌关哑咽畜哀怨，开笼放飞离人眼。\n短声亦绝翠臆翻，新墓崔嵬旧巢远。\n此禽有志女有灵，定爲连理相并生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}